sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser<br/>(React SPA)
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant Fastify as Node.js Fastify<br/>Backend
    participant BFF as Go BFF Sidecar<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Platform as Platform Services<br/>(KServe, MLflow, etc.)

    Note over Browser,Platform: User Request Flow (SPA + API Proxy)

    Browser->>Route: GET / (HTTPS/443)
    Route->>KRBAC: Forward (TLS termination)
    KRBAC->>Fastify: Forward (authenticated)<br/>x-forwarded-access-token
    Fastify-->>Browser: React SPA + static assets

    Note over Browser,Platform: Kubernetes API Proxy Flow

    Browser->>Route: ALL /api/k8s/* (HTTPS/443)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Route->>KRBAC: TLS termination
    KRBAC->>Fastify: x-forwarded-access-token
    Fastify->>K8sAPI: Impersonated request<br/>User identity from token
    K8sAPI-->>Fastify: K8s resource response
    Fastify-->>Browser: JSON response

    Note over Browser,Platform: WebSocket Watch Flow

    Browser->>Route: WS /wss/k8s/* (WSS/443)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Route->>KRBAC: TLS + upgrade
    KRBAC->>Fastify: WebSocket connection
    Fastify->>K8sAPI: Watch stream<br/>Impersonated
    K8sAPI-->>Fastify: Watch events (streaming)
    Fastify-->>Browser: WebSocket events

    Note over Browser,Platform: Module Federation BFF Flow

    Browser->>Route: ALL /_mf/:name/api/v1/*<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Route->>KRBAC: TLS termination
    KRBAC->>Fastify: x-forwarded-access-token
    Fastify->>BFF: Proxy to BFF sidecar<br/>Bearer Token forwarded
    BFF->>Platform: HTTPS REST/gRPC-web<br/>Bearer Token or SA Token
    Platform-->>BFF: Service response
    BFF-->>Fastify: JSON response
    Fastify-->>Browser: JSON response

    Note over Browser,Platform: Operator Reconciliation Flow

    participant Operator as Dashboard Operator<br/>controller-runtime

    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch: Dashboard CR created/updated
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment<br/>SA Token + RBAC
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Service, Route
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create RBAC objects
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Update Dashboard CR status

    Note over Browser,Platform: Admission Webhook Flow

    K8sAPI->>Operator: POST /validate-dashboard<br/>TLS/9443
    Operator-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response (allow/deny)

    K8sAPI->>Operator: POST /validate-workspace<br/>TLS/9443
    Operator-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response (allow/deny)
